# harbor#617 — the schedule of launchd/com.harbor.status.fleet-snapshot.plist; docs/reference/checks.md row `status.fleet-snapshot`.
[Unit]
Description=Harbor check fleet-snapshot (schedule)

[Timer]
OnActiveSec=30s
OnUnitActiveSec=300s
Unit=harbor-status-fleet-snapshot.service

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
